{"id":"rva3-001","question":"项目总结是在多大的本地内存约束下完成技术选型的？","evidence":[{"evidence_id":"e1","chunk_id":"be386c48-2c17-426c-90db-7baa8e007d7f","document_logical_name":"第 7 课：工程化专题 + 面试实战","heading_path":["第 7 课：工程化专题 + 面试实战","一、教案正文","7.7 学完整个项目后应该形成的认知"],"span_text":"> AgentMentor 的核心价值不是\"用大模型生成三道题\"，而是把学习资料、可溯源检索、人机工作流、可信评分和长期画像连接成一个受约束的训练闭环。系统通过应用层规则限制 LLM 的权力，通过 checkpoint 和幂等保证流程状态，通过两层画像控制长期记忆粒度，再通过增量知识目录区分\"回答得怎么样\"和\"资料是否考到\"，形成补缺与查漏两类训练信号；并在 16GB 本地约束下选择 PostgreSQL、本地 BGE-small-zh 和模块化单体。它已经是一个真实可运行的个人学习系统，但还不是企业级终态；当前已补同知识库最近历史题目冷却，全量语义题库去重、复杂文档、生产检索评测、租户权限和可靠异步任务是明确的演进方向。","span_sha256":"9c6fb761ea2a1739f00abb188cd5d6a38fc76d67bf875366af4d5026607873ad","source_content_hash":"ef0ab6bdde4cdd1972bb8535c0e6afd9172fc5ede2b75b72bec28239ce729c11"}],"reviewer_annotation":{"answerability":"full","confusion_type":null,"primary_relation_role":"exact","primary_span_type":"sentence_span","demands":[{"demand_id":"d1","requested_relation":"项目技术选型所处的本地内存约束","relation_role":"exact","value_semantic":"count","canonical_unit":"GB","expected_binding":true,"accepted_value_sets":[["16"]],"evidence_ids":["e1"],"required_relation_terms":["本地约束","技术选型"],"modality":"fact","rationale":"证据明确写明在 16GB 本地约束下完成选型。"}],"rationale":"证据直接绑定项目选型、本地内存约束和 16GB。"}}
{"id":"rva3-002","question":"文档插入内容前旧块索引是多少，插入后该旧块的新索引是多少？","evidence":[{"evidence_id":"e1","chunk_id":"cd038e3e-d8c7-4c17-b139-533e4d98d823","document_logical_name":"第 2 课：知识入库链路——文档如何变成可检索证据","heading_path":["第 2 课：知识入库链路——文档如何变成可检索证据","二、学员疑问与讨论记录","Q2：文档大幅重排问题，面试中怎么回答？没有企业经验会难吗？","方案 1：内容指纹（本地就能做，本质是 Hash 去重的延伸）"],"span_text":"当前：chunk_index=3 匹配 chunk_index=3\n      → 文档中间插入一段后，旧的第3块变成了第4块 → 匹配失败 ❌","span_sha256":"71297d17fcb2eee8405a1515d067d780484790e0ce31349a86477260ed6eb547","source_content_hash":"b04f184e397c458d8b5b18bb9c3de0711a7701d464931ce0365676cdebb30a72"}],"reviewer_annotation":{"answerability":"full","confusion_type":null,"primary_relation_role":"exact","primary_span_type":"sentence_span","demands":[{"demand_id":"d1","requested_relation":"插入内容前旧块的 chunk_index","relation_role":"exact","value_semantic":"count","canonical_unit":null,"expected_binding":true,"accepted_value_sets":[["3"]],"evidence_ids":["e1"],"required_relation_terms":["插入前","旧块","chunk_index"],"modality":"fact","rationale":"当前旧块索引为 3。"},{"demand_id":"d2","requested_relation":"插入内容后同一旧块的新 chunk_index","relation_role":"exact","value_semantic":"count","canonical_unit":null,"expected_binding":true,"accepted_value_sets":[["4"]],"evidence_ids":["e1"],"required_relation_terms":["插入后","旧块","新索引"],"modality":"fact","rationale":"中间插入一段后，旧第 3 块变成第 4 块。"}],"rationale":"同一旧块在插入前后分别绑定索引 3 和 4。"}}
{"id":"rva3-003","question":"四维示例由应用层相加应得多少分，LLM 当时错误写成多少分？","evidence":[{"evidence_id":"e1","chunk_id":"141180c3-1581-420e-aabc-aa107e3a7083","document_logical_name":"第 5 课：可信评分与报告","heading_path":["第 5 课：可信评分与报告","一、教案正文","5.3 应用层重算总分"],"span_text":"\n```python\ndef total_score(output: EvaluationOutput) -> int:\n    return output.correctness + output.completeness + output.reasoning + output.communication\n```\n\n写入数据库时：\n\n```python\nevaluation = EvaluationModel(\n    correctness=output.correctness,\n    ...,\n    total=total_score(output),       # ← 应用层重算，不读 LLM 返回的 total\n)\n```\n\n原因：LLM 可能算错加法——`4+3+2+4=13` 但 LLM 写了 `15`。Python 的 `+` 不会错。","span_sha256":"05077122ed190de2318e4683f5b9f5802379a3539d7cdcd848f9eee4a6ce6c0a","source_content_hash":"62e9d7eb7a9dd7c12ec9ff93ac7fd07794e7e1f51b15890620db7defe44fe87b"}],"reviewer_annotation":{"answerability":"full","confusion_type":null,"primary_relation_role":"derived_value","primary_span_type":"bounded_multi_span","demands":[{"demand_id":"d1","requested_relation":"四维分数由应用层相加得到的总分","relation_role":"derived_value","value_semantic":"score","canonical_unit":"分","expected_binding":true,"accepted_value_sets":[["13"]],"evidence_ids":["e1"],"required_relation_terms":["四维","应用层重算","总分"],"modality":"fact","rationale":"按证据给出的 4+3+2+4 求和为 13。"},{"demand_id":"d2","requested_relation":"LLM 当时写出的错误总分","relation_role":"exact","value_semantic":"score","canonical_unit":"分","expected_binding":true,"accepted_value_sets":[["15"]],"evidence_ids":["e1"],"required_relation_terms":["LLM","写了","总分"],"modality":"fact","rationale":"证据明确说 LLM 写了 15。"}],"rationale":"证据同时给出正确派生总分 13 和 LLM 错写值 15。"}}
