{"id":"rva3-016","question":"RRF 遍历排名时 rank 的起始下界是多少？","evidence":[{"evidence_id":"e1","chunk_id":"18c119d0-41a3-4767-83bd-f3027993a40e","document_logical_name":"第 3 课：混合检索与可信 RAG 回答","heading_path":["第 3 课：混合检索与可信 RAG 回答","一、教案正文","3.3 RRF 融合：为什么不能直接加分数","RRF 公式"],"span_text":"def reciprocal_rank_fusion(ranked_lists, *, rrf_k=60):\n    scores = {}\n    for ranked in ranked_lists:\n        for rank, chunk_id in enumerate(ranked, start=1):\n            scores[chunk_id] = scores.get(chunk_id, 0.0) + 1.0 / (rrf_k + rank)","span_sha256":"95e64b41c6b3b592b5c28dbc446493f90d7026558cca80e3f19eb5b4a754d22a","source_content_hash":"f0ef6b515c3b004b6573dbcdb16c4c821f095e05c3698aea2704bf26f29d9387"}],"reviewer_annotation":{"answerability":"full","confusion_type":null,"primary_relation_role":"lower_bound","primary_span_type":"code_statement","demands":[{"demand_id":"d1","requested_relation":"RRF 遍历时 rank 的起始下界","relation_role":"lower_bound","value_semantic":"count","canonical_unit":null,"expected_binding":true,"accepted_value_sets":[["1"]],"evidence_ids":["e1"],"required_relation_terms":["rank","起始","enumerate"],"modality":"fact","rationale":"enumerate(ranked, start=1) 使 rank 从 1 开始。"}],"rationale":"代码明确给出包含端点 1 的起始下界。"}}
