{"id":"rva3-018","question":"示例中的历史引用版本是多少，文档重排后的新内容版本是多少？","evidence":[{"evidence_id":"e1","chunk_id":"4e4f757d-00ec-44b8-af49-149c9bede454","document_logical_name":"第 2 课：知识入库链路——文档如何变成可检索证据","heading_path":["第 2 课：知识入库链路——文档如何变成可检索证据","二、学员疑问与讨论记录","Q2：文档大幅重排问题，面试中怎么回答？没有企业经验会难吗？","方案 3：版本化引用（企业级方案，说你理解思路即可）"],"span_text":"旧逻辑：interview.question.reference_chunk_id → chunk(id=42)\n新逻辑：interview.question.reference_chunk_id → chunk(id=42, version=v3)\n\n文档重排后：chunk(id=42, version=v4) 是一块新内容\n但历史引用仍然指向 chunk(id=42, version=v3) → 保留在历史快照中","span_sha256":"fbe14b7baf95fb961183ad84f5ef27a0ca9444a28ea2de7232cca27b67c20e4a","source_content_hash":"b04f184e397c458d8b5b18bb9c3de0711a7701d464931ce0365676cdebb30a72"}],"reviewer_annotation":{"answerability":"full","confusion_type":null,"primary_relation_role":"exact","primary_span_type":"bounded_multi_span","demands":[{"demand_id":"d1","requested_relation":"历史引用保留的 chunk 版本","relation_role":"exact","value_semantic":"generic","canonical_unit":null,"expected_binding":true,"accepted_value_sets":[[["v3"]],["3"]],"evidence_ids":["e1"],"required_relation_terms":["历史引用","version"],"modality":"fact","rationale":"历史引用仍指向 version=v3。"},{"demand_id":"d2","requested_relation":"文档重排后新内容的 chunk 版本","relation_role":"exact","value_semantic":"generic","canonical_unit":null,"expected_binding":true,"accepted_value_sets":[[["v4"]],["4"]],"evidence_ids":["e1"],"required_relation_terms":["文档重排后","新内容","version"],"modality":"fact","rationale":"重排后的新内容为 version=v4。"}],"rationale":"跨相邻说明分别绑定历史快照 v3 与新内容 v4。"}}
