{"id":"rva3-034","question":"示例中 interview 引用的 v4 能否证明另一份 SourceDocument 的版本也是 4？","evidence":[{"evidence_id":"e1","chunk_id":"4e4f757d-00ec-44b8-af49-149c9bede454","document_logical_name":"第 2 课：知识入库链路——文档如何变成可检索证据","heading_path":["第 2 课：知识入库链路——文档如何变成可检索证据","二、学员疑问与讨论记录","Q2：文档大幅重排问题，面试中怎么回答？没有企业经验会难吗？","方案 3：版本化引用（企业级方案，说你理解思路即可）"],"span_text":"旧逻辑：interview.question.reference_chunk_id → chunk(id=42)\n新逻辑：interview.question.reference_chunk_id → chunk(id=42, version=v3)\n\n文档重排后：chunk(id=42, version=v4) 是一块新内容\n但历史引用仍然指向 chunk(id=42, version=v3) → 保留在历史快照中","span_sha256":"fbe14b7baf95fb961183ad84f5ef27a0ca9444a28ea2de7232cca27b67c20e4a","source_content_hash":"b04f184e397c458d8b5b18bb9c3de0711a7701d464931ce0365676cdebb30a72"}],"reviewer_annotation":{"answerability":"none","confusion_type":"provenance_structure","primary_relation_role":"exact","primary_span_type":"bounded_multi_span","demands":[{"demand_id":"d1","requested_relation":"另一份 SourceDocument 的版本是否为 4","relation_role":"exact","value_semantic":"generic","canonical_unit":null,"expected_binding":false,"accepted_value_sets":[],"evidence_ids":[],"required_relation_terms":["另一份SourceDocument","版本"],"modality":"fact","rationale":"v4 只绑定示例中的 chunk(id=42)，未提供另一文档来源。"}],"rationale":"值存在于当前示例，但不能跨来源外推。"}}
{"id":"rva3-035","question":"词汇证据代码是否给出了线上 P95 为 3 毫秒？","evidence":[{"evidence_id":"e1","chunk_id":"3323ef24-284f-4557-8f6f-e8552da6f827","document_logical_name":"第 3 课：混合检索与可信 RAG 回答","heading_path":["第 3 课：混合检索与可信 RAG 回答","一、教案正文","3.6 第一道防线：词汇化证据判断"],"span_text":"    context_terms = set()\n    for chunk in candidates[:3]:\n        context_terms.update(self._evidence_terms(chunk.content))\n        context_terms.update(term.lower() for term in chunk.heading_path)\n\n    overlap = query_terms & context_terms\n    # 英文：只要有一词重叠就算通过\n    # 中文：至少 2 个 bigram 重叠，且占比 ≥ 18%","span_sha256":"5eff320b517fa7adaaa60e5c15bdf86261b6ce89993ce5153b6fbfb4b772a56d","source_content_hash":"f0ef6b515c3b004b6573dbcdb16c4c821f095e05c3698aea2704bf26f29d9387"}],"reviewer_annotation":{"answerability":"none","confusion_type":"missing_value_false_premise","primary_relation_role":"exact","primary_span_type":"code_statement","demands":[{"demand_id":"d1","requested_relation":"词汇证据代码的线上 P95 是否为 3 毫秒","relation_role":"exact","value_semantic":"duration","canonical_unit":"毫秒","expected_binding":false,"accepted_value_sets":[],"evidence_ids":[],"required_relation_terms":["词汇证据代码","线上P95"],"modality":"fact","rationale":"数字 3 仅是候选切片上限，证据未给出线上 P95。"}],"rationale":"请求的性能值在证据中缺失。"}}
{"id":"rva3-036","question":"难度因子 1.15 是否是生产服务实测 QPS？","evidence":[{"evidence_id":"e1","chunk_id":"0f83382d-b522-4948-ac5f-adacaee276e4","document_logical_name":"第 6 课：两层画像与复习闭环","heading_path":["第 6 课：两层画像与复习闭环","一、教案正文","6.5 为什么高分后画像不会立刻满分——渐进更新"],"span_text":"    difficulty_factor = {\n        \"easy\": 0.85,\n        \"medium\": 1.0,\n        \"hard\": 1.15,\n    }.get(difficulty, 1.0)","span_sha256":"8d5536762abcea21bcce6543ef6440bacd63a9ef5bb0c0bf5cee4a210efc6b7a","source_content_hash":"df1c34601fe13e54931a228bd1de781a36f1ca1073c3c374882b0c7ef393f8f9"}],"reviewer_annotation":{"answerability":"none","confusion_type":"missing_value_false_premise","primary_relation_role":"exact","primary_span_type":"code_statement","demands":[{"demand_id":"d1","requested_relation":"生产服务实测 QPS 是否为 1.15","relation_role":"exact","value_semantic":"rate","canonical_unit":"QPS","expected_binding":false,"accepted_value_sets":[],"evidence_ids":[],"required_relation_terms":["生产服务","实测QPS"],"modality":"fact","rationale":"1.15 是 hard 难度因子，证据没有生产 QPS 实测。"}],"rationale":"请求的生产性能值在证据中缺失。"}}
